<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 5.200 pct on Portugal 364-day bills.</title>
<headline>Yield 5.200 pct on Portugal 364-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on Portuguese 364-day bills rose to 5.200 percent from 5.198 previously at the Institute for Public Credit Management's sale, The Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The institute placed all the 20 billion escudos on offer.</p>
